            "title": "Landfill biogas sees steady growth, plus RNG news from Anaergia, Vanguard, Montauk Renewables",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Investment in landfill biogas capacity has topped $1 billion for two straight years. New policies\u00a0drove announcements in August, including for shipping fuel.",
