              "originalWidth": 1600,
              "originalHeight": 900,
              "caption": "CMA CGM Group made a minority investment in biogas company Vanguard Renewables to secure long-term access to the company's renewable natural gas. The move is meant to advance the shipping company's decarbonization goals as the International Maritime Organization urges progress.",
              "resolutions": [
                {
                  "url": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/_LbYRkHTes5aTfwYHOjRcg--~B/aD05MDA7dz0xNjAwO2FwcGlkPXl0YWNoeW9u/https://media.zenfs.com/en/waste_dive_134/7d52180485f9da31da0729f9ad4f3d17",
